{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：10:46 2026-09-16 HKT</p>\n<p>外媒報道，伊朗塞佩赫蘭航空（Sepehran Airlines）一架波音737客機日前突發故障，客艙天花板掉落，乘客驚慌尖叫，客機最終要緊急降落。消息指，事故中未有乘客受傷。</p>\n<img alt=\"飛機故障時，天花板部件脫落。X@Mukund Shahi\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ef480ed0bf393a48de224694c57fee8a/2026-09/SrhQdDkQF0sh6iv0_mp4_snapshot_00_22__2026_09_16_10_35_26_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"飛機故障時，天花板部件脫落。X@Mukund Shahi\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2f115962e6cc12ebefbf28e4d7f3d8c8/2026-09/SrhQdDkQF0sh6iv0_mp4_snapshot_00_21__2026_09_16_10_35_21_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"飛機故障時，天花板部件脫落。X@Mukund Shahi\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/42a7a73ba992e3b7d826eacbfa124deb/2026-09/SrhQdDkQF0sh6iv0_mp4_snapshot_00_11__2026_09_16_10_35_07_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"飛機故障時，天花板部件脫落。X@Mukund Shahi\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/42bb75d275616451de0cd3397d1bfb72/2026-09/SrhQdDkQF0sh6iv0_mp4_snapshot_00_06__2026_09_16_10_35_00_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"飛機故障時，天花板部件脫落。X@Mukund Shahi\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dcc81ffada26fd3f7b519e18e6631144/2026-09/SrhQdDkQF0sh6iv0_mp4_snapshot_00_04__2026_09_16_10_34_54_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"飛機故障時，天花板部件脫落。X@Mukund Shahi\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3733951bb2fba2b67b3094189c97087c/2026-09/SrhQdDkQF0sh6iv0_mp4_snapshot_00_02__2026_09_16_10_34_48_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"飛機故障時，天花板部件脫落。X@Mukund Shahi\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/98fa620e052231ab3d2690c7f81d6bae/2026-09/SrhQdDkQF0sh6iv0_mp4_snapshot_00_01__2026_09_16_10_34_43_.jpg\"/>\n<p>據悉，客機原定於從馬什哈德飛往克爾曼沙赫，起飛後不久便出現輪胎脫落，令引擎受損。網上影片所見，客機當時劇烈震盪，天花板及機頂行李倉損毀，乘客行李掉落。乘客極度驚恐，有人更嚇至尖叫。</p>\n<p>機艙人員宣佈進入緊急狀態，將客機折返至馬什哈德機場。最終客機安全降落。受此事件影響，馬什哈德機場一跑道暫時關閉。<br/> </p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-16T02:59:47.685087+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":261,"images":7,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}